
units           metal
dimension       3
boundary        p p p
atom_style      atomic

read_data       relaxed.data
Reading data file ...
  orthogonal box = (-0.0025810828 0.012814222 -0.028236694) to (41.050581 40.61417 42.184237)
  3 by 2 by 5 MPI processor grid
